WEBVTT

00:04:29.836 --> 00:04:31.236
random florists.

00:04:31.276 --> 00:04:32.476
And I started discovering

00:04:32.516 --> 00:04:34.756
that there was an entire side
to San Francisco

00:04:34.756 --> 00:04:37.716
that I had been ignoring
because of my preference.

00:04:40.596 --> 00:04:42.556
And then I started thinking,

00:04:42.556 --> 00:04:45.396
how else can I apply
this concept to my life?

00:04:46.156 --> 00:04:49.396
And so I started building other
experiments that involved randomness.

00:04:49.436 --> 00:04:51.316
I made a random
YouTube video generator,

00:04:51.316 --> 00:04:53.116
a random schedule generator,

00:04:53.156 --> 00:04:54.596
a random diet club

00:04:54.636 --> 00:04:58.716
that would randomly eliminate a food
from my diet each week.

00:04:58.756 --> 00:05:00.036
(Laughter)